@HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5199

### Listar abastecimentos
GET {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/refuelling
Accept: application/json

### Criar abastecimento
POST {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/refuelling
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liters": 10.5,
  "blAdditive": false,
  "mileage": 12500,
  "blFullTank": true,
  "gasPrice": 5.79
}

### Consultar gasto mensal
GET {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/monthly-expense?month=1&year=2026
Accept: application/json

### Consultar consumo médio
GET {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/average-consumption
Accept: application/json

### Listar manutenções
GET {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/maintenance
Accept: application/json

### Criar manutenção
POST {{HolyGauge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Troca de óleo",
  "date": "2026-01-15T10:00:00",
  "kilometers": 12500,
  "cost": 120.00,
  "nextKilometers": 15500,
  "nextDate": "2026-04-15T10:00:00",
  "notes": "Óleo 10W-30"
}
